    "registration": {
      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "CH'ÊN Kuo-jui 陳國瑞 (T. 慶雲), 1837-1883, Feb. 7, general, was a native of Ying-ch'êng, Hupeh. He was about eight sui when his father died. During the years 1852–54 the Taiping forces, then in Ying-ch'êng, detained him but he managed to escape, either by his own efforts or by the help of government troops.",
          "source": "eccp-3633525",
          "kind": "source-wording",
          "status": "imported"
        },
        {
          "text": "陳國瑞，字慶雲，湖北應城人。",
